      "rawCompletion": {
        "text": "To achieve the desired functionality, we need to add a button with the ID `clear-filter` to the HTML and modify the JavaScript code to handle the click event on this button. When the button is clicked, we will clear the value of the input field and set the display style of all list items to `''`, effectively making them visible again. Here's the updated HTML and JavaScript code:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head><title>s04</title></head>\n<body>\n<h2>s04</h2>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"needle\">\n<button id=\"clear-filter\">Clear Filter</button>\n<ol id=\"stack\">\n  <li class=\"item\">lisbon</li>\n  <li class=\"item\">lima</li>\n  <li class=\"item\">cairo</li>\n  <li class=\"item\">oslo</li>\n  <li class=\"item\">dakar</li>\n</ol>\n<script>\nconst model = { query: '' };\nconst field = document.getElementById('needle');\nconst rows = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#stack .item'));\nconst clearFilterButton = document.getElementById('clear-filter');\n\nfunction redraw() {\n  model.query = field.value.toLowerCase();\n  const q = model.query;\n  rows.forEach(function (el) {\n    const hit = el.textContent.toLowerCase().indexOf(q) !== -1;\n    el.style.display = hit ? '' : 'none';\n  });\n}\n\nfield.addEventListener('input', redraw);\nclearFilterButton.addEventListener('click', function () {\n  field.value = '';\n  redraw();\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n### Explanation:\n1. **HTML Changes**:\n   - Added a `<button>` element with the ID `clear-filter` to the HTML.\n   - The `clear-filter` button is positioned next to the input field.\n\n2. **JavaScript Changes**:\n   - Added a `clearFilterButton` variable to reference the button element.\n   - Added an event listener to the `clear-filter` button that listens for the `click` event.\n   - When the button is clicked, it sets the value of the input field to an empty string (`field.value = ''`) and then calls the `redraw` function to clear the display of all list items.\n\nThis way, when the user clicks the \"Clear Filter\" button, the input field is cleared, and all list items are made visible again. The typing in the filter still narrows the list as expected.",
